  "messages": [
    "First call the Agent tool exactly once, with subagent_type \"general-purpose\" and run_in_background true, and give the subagent this task word for word: 'Read the file chain/first.txt with the Read tool. Each file of the chain names the next file. Follow the chain with one Read call per response, never two in one response, until a file gives the final word. Report the final word.' Then do this yourself, without waiting for the subagent: Read the file chain/start.txt with the Read tool. Each file of the chain names the next file. Follow the chain with one Read call per response, never two in one response, until a file gives the final word. Answer with the final word of your own chain."
